<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10577"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 5:38 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Another thought. Rader lived at 6220 if information about his address is correct. Jonbenet was killed on 12/26, close to the reverse of 0226.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
