<!--/Post: 12765-->
<!--Post: 12889--><!--Time: 1113583914-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12889"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, April 15, 2005 - 9:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Found some possible connections to a book called &#34;The Executioners.&#34; I mention this because of JonBenet being on the possible suspect list. <BR> <BR>The day the Bowdens were intruded on by Cady was JonBenet&#39;s birthday August 6th. Described in the book as a &#34;golden day.&#34; We know August 6, 1996 was JonBenet&#39;s golden birthday. In the book, Bowden is armed with a flashlight and a gun trying to save his wife &#40;kids aren&#39;t home&#41;.  <BR> <BR>The Bowdens had two staircases also, with a trap called a &#34;Rube Goldberg trap of pans and string blocking both stairways.&#34; Remember in the Ramsey case Mrs Santa had written a play called &#34;Hey Rube&#34; about the similar crime against their own daughter. <BR><a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rube_Goldberg" target=_top>http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rube_Goldberg</a> <BR> <BR>Also, John Walsh&#39;s birthday is December 26th.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12889-->
<!--Post: 12896--><!--Time: 1113607587-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12896"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Angrywolf<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Angrywolf<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, April 15, 2005 - 4:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The idea that Jon Benet was murdered by BTK is so ludicrous it&#39;s worthy of something brought out in a comedy club and not for any serious discussion..The person who murdered her was most likely someone who was a burglar..part of the outfit running rampant in Boulder that the police there chose to ignore...probably the same guy who tried to rape the other girl who used the same skating rink...this guy is a burglar who is also a pedophile most likely...and most certainly not BTK... <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12896-->
<!--Post: 12910--><!--Time: 1113695860-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12910"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, April 16, 2005 - 4:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Angrywolf, <BR>JonBenet&#39;s murder is unsolved, so my feeling is to keep an open mind. How the Barbie dolls were tied similar to Josephine is what&#39;s making me think twice. If it isn&#39;t BTK, possibly pictures were leaked, like the morgue pictures of JonBenet to explain it. Maybe someone copycatted the ties. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12910-->
<!--Post: 12914--><!--Time: 1113713045-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12914"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, April 16, 2005 - 9:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Angry: The idea of Dennis Rader living 6 houses down the street from my family is ludicrious! There are several similarities that shouldn&#39;t be over looked in these crimes. You can&#39;t overlook any possibility with this monster.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12914-->
<!--Post: 12924--><!--Time: 1113768685-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12924"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Angrywolf<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Angrywolf<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 17, 2005 - 1:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Didn&#39;t know that Rocky...maybe I was too harsh..If I were you I would be glad your grass wasn&#39;t too long or something that might have irritated him about your family..I will be gentle..but I will still say it&#39;s unlikely he killed Jon Benet.....One of the things I hadn&#39;t considered is her frequency of appearing on the local tv stations there..She had recently been in a parade..and yes she wore what some people believe were provative outfits for a child...Showing her legs...maybe showing her in revealing below the waist outfits...that might have turned on a sexual predator...and knowing she lived there in Boulder..made her attainable....<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12924-->
<!--Post: 12929--><!--Time: 1113789140-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12929"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 17, 2005 - 6:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Angry: here is something else you didn&#39;t apparently realize - the monster murdered my mothers best friend &#40;Marine Hedge&#41; and she lived just 4 houses away from him. I understand that these ideas, theories, and speculations do sound a bit far fetched &#40;when I first read this one I had the same thoughts you do&#41; but you really can&#39;t discount any possibility with this monster! <BR> <BR>I really appreciate any and all thoughts that provoke discussion on this board, but you will never convince me that an innocent 6 year old little girl&#40;however provacative you might think she was&#41; deserved to be murdered in the fashion that she was by the monster that she was murdered by.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12929-->
<!--Post: 12937--><!--Time: 1113799969-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12937"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 17, 2005 - 9:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Does Southwestern Bell Telephone Company cover Colorado and California? Just wondering. <BR> <BR>Serial killers and just killers, get ideas from each other as well as through media. They&#39;re probably reading and watching the same stuff.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
