<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12966"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 18, 2005 - 9:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Book - our service is now Qwest. I can&#39;t for the life of me remember who it would have been in 1996! I&#39;ll keep given it some thought! <BR> <BR>Your right about serial killers mirroring each other, this case did bring a lot of national attention and DTDC probably got the idea of the doll from this one.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
