<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13240"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, April 27, 2005 - 2:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Else - As I have posted before, yes they had two pine trees in their front yard. Where did the pine tree come from that covered her body? That&#39;s the questions. <BR> <BR>Book &amp; Else, I&#39;m pretty sure they had an ADT system. I remember seeing the signs in pics of the house during the media&#39;s coverage of the murder. Maybe, I can find some old pics of that crime scene on line. <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
