<!--Post: 14227--><!--Time: 1125500707-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST14227"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, August 31, 2005 - 8:05 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->WOW Itty - also - I read that he also had a binder that contained celebrities....hmmm...I can&#39;t remember his code name for it...I will try to find it.. <BR>Wonder if Jon Benet was in it...along with just how many other little girl and boy celebrities <BR>The scum<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 14227-->
<!--Post: 14240--><!--Time: 1125629616-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST14240"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bookworm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bookworm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, September 01, 2005 - 7:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Itty, <BR>I wonder what Rader ment when he said he &#34;was working on&#34; a golden star?  The sun is also a star. <BR> <BR>Under the Japanese Zodiac, Rader was born in the year of the Rooster. &#40;He was stationed in Japan.&#41; <BR>The Rooster crows at dawn &#40;sunrise&#41;. Maybe he takes his sign seriously. <BR> <BR>The Coleman&#39;s had a sun on their logo, ADT had a type of sun on one of their logos <BR><a href="http://www.antestar.com/images/Dealer%20Logo%20no%20back%20copy.jpg" target=_top>http://www.antestar.com/images/Dealer%20Logo%20no% 20back%20copy.jpg</a> <BR> <BR>John Ramsey did business with Sun Microsystems didn&#39;t he? Like you said, Jon Benet was crowned &#34;Miss Sunburst Colorado.&#34; <BR> <BR>When Jon Benet was found the autopsy report said her shirt had &#34;an embroidered silver star decorated with silver sequins&#34;. <BR> <BR>Wasn&#39;t the Little Miss Hawaiian Tropic Pageant supposed to be in Las Vegas? <BR> <BR>Elsewhere, did you read that in the Enquirer? <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 14240-->
<!--Post: 14252--><!--Time: 1125660417-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST14252"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, September 02, 2005 - 4:26 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This is getting very weird.   <BR>Is it enough to contact le? Probably not. <BR> <BR>Bookworm, the shirt she was found in, was it the one she wore to bed? <BR> <BR>Now here comes my imagination.... <BR>Christmas nite, after everyone is asleep, Santa visits little Jon personally. He tells her to keep quiet, becasue he left one more present for her, its in the basement. We know the end result. <BR> <BR>If Santa showed up to a six year olds room, she wouldnt scream or be scared.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
